\title{List of open problems}
\author{trebor}

\p{
  The following is a list of open (to my knowledge) problems that I’m interested in, with some thoughts on them. They are mostly in type theory, constructive logic and computability theory. I think about them from time to time, and if any problem is already solved in the literature, or has a new claimed solution, please contact [me](trebor)!
}

